--- ============================================================
--- copyObjAttrs1 (persistent source)
--- ============================================================

--- [BB-P-CO-1] copy-object-attributes-persistent-source (the single copy-object-attrs-try-ret-attrs rule
--- answers from a persistent source; the copy then sets the attributes on the uninitialized transient target)
search [1] in TEST-AUX :
  < ta : TAKernel | status : (normal).AppStatus, api-call : init(copyObjAttrs1[# oid(3, ta) # oid(2, ta)]), counter : 0, storage : oid(0, ta) >
  < oid(2, ta) : ObjectHandle | oid : oid(1, oid(0, ta)), flags : accessRead, pos : 0 >
  < oid(1, oid(0, ta)) : PersistentObject | type : typeAes, max-size : 128, attributes : attr(secretValue, randomAttrVal), usages : usageEncrypt, file-name : testFileId >
  < oid(3, ta) : ObjectHandle | oid : t, flags : empty, pos : 0 >
  < t : TransientObject | type : typeAes, max-size : 128, usages : usageEncrypt, attributes : empty, initialized : false >
=>*
  < ta : TAKernel | api-call : return(copyObjAttrs1[# success]) > .
